        "content": "<p>pmnmalo opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/14794\">issue #14794</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The WASI preview1 component adapter traps with <code>unreachable</code> in <code>Descriptors::open</code> when a program opens a file while a few other files are still open, nested. As whitequark noted in the downstream report, the trap is probably this <code>unreachable!</code>: <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/blob/main/crates/wasi-preview1-component-adapter/src/descriptors.rs#L310\">https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/blob/main/crates/wasi-preview1-component-adapter/src/descriptors.rs#L310</a>. Its message is also misleading: it should say that the freelist points to an open descriptor.</p>\n<p>Downstream report, with the discussion: <a href=\"https://codeberg.org/YoWASP/yosys/issues/41\">https://codeberg.org/YoWASP/yosys/issues/41</a> (YoWASP Yosys: Yosys + ABC compiled to WASI, adapted to a component with the preview1 adapter, and run in Node through jco).</p>\n<h3>Reproduction</h3>\n<p>@yowasp/yosys 0.68.1207 and 0.70.1258, Node 25:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"JavaScript\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"k\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">runYosys</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kr\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s1\">'@yowasp/yosys'</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"kd\">const</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">files</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"s1\">'t.v'</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s1\">'module top(input a, b, c, output y); assign y = (a &amp; b) | c; endmodule\\n'</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"s1\">'lut.lib'</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s1\">'1 1 1\\n2 1 1\\n3 1 1\\n4 1 1\\n'</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"s1\">'x.abc'</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s1\">'read_lut lut.lib\\n'</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"p\">};</span>\n<span class=\"c1\">// traps: RuntimeError: unreachable</span>\n<span class=\"k\">await</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">runYosys</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"s1\">'-p'</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s1\">'read_verilog t.v; proc; techmap; abc -script x.abc'</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">files</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"c1\">// works: the same command given inline</span>\n<span class=\"k\">await</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">runYosys</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"s1\">'-p'</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s1\">'read_verilog t.v; proc; techmap; abc -script +read_lut,lut.lib;strash;if'</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">files</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>The two calls differ in nesting. In the first, Yosys's ABC script <code>source</code>s <code>x.abc</code>, whose file is still open, and <code>read_lut</code> then calls <code>fopen</code> on <code>lut.lib</code>. In the second there is one <code>source</code> level less, and the same <code>fopen</code> works. A missing file (<code>read_lut nothing.lib</code>) gives ABC's normal \"Cannot open input file\" error, not a trap. Native Yosys runs both without error.</p>\n<h3>Backtrace (Node, @yowasp/yosys 0.70.1258)</h3>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Rust\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">RuntimeError</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">unreachable</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">_ZN22wasi_snapshot_preview111descriptors11Descriptors4open17hf43b776c170aa288E</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"c1\">//wasm/00021de6:wasm-function[102]:0x4cac)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">path_open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"c1\">//wasm/00021de6:wasm-function[78]:0x3472)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"c1\">//wasm/c8fd64d6:wasm-function[18]:0x317</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yosys</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">__wasi_path_open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">function</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">46148</span><span class=\"p\">]:</span><span class=\"mh\">0x2875534</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yosys</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">__wasilibc_nocwd_openat_nomode</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">function</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">46157</span><span class=\"p\">]:</span><span class=\"mh\">0x28756da</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yosys</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">__wasilibc_open_nomode</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">function</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">46174</span><span class=\"p\">]:</span><span class=\"mh\">0x287620a</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yosys</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">fopen</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">function</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">46359</span><span class=\"p\">]:</span><span class=\"mh\">0x28816ad</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yosys</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">abc</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">If_CommandReadLut</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">abc</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">Abc_Frame_t_</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">int</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">char</span><span class=\"o\">**</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">function</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">23010</span><span class=\"p\">]:</span><span class=\"mh\">0x1828002</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yosys</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">abc</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">CmdCommandDispatch</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"p\">.)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yosys</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">abc</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">Cmd_CommandExecute</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"p\">.)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yosys</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">abc</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">CmdCommandSource</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">abc</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">Abc_Frame_t_</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">int</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">char</span><span class=\"o\">**</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">function</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">19831</span><span class=\"p\">]:</span><span class=\"mh\">0x14b75c8</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yosys</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">abc</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">CmdCommandDispatch</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"p\">.)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yosys</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">abc</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">Cmd_CommandExecute</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"p\">.)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yosys</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">abc</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">CmdCommandSource</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">abc</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">Abc_Frame_t_</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">int</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">char</span><span class=\"o\">**</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">function</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">19831</span><span class=\"p\">]:</span><span class=\"mh\">0x14b75c8</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yosys</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">abc</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">CmdCommandDispatch</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"p\">.)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yosys</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">abc</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">Cmd_CommandExecute</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"p\">.)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yosys</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">abc</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">Abc_RealMain</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">int</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">char</span><span class=\"o\">**</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">function</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">21311</span><span class=\"p\">]:</span><span class=\"mh\">0x1618f7e</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yosys</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">.(</span><span class=\"n\">anonymous</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">namespace</span><span class=\"p\">)::</span><span class=\"n\">RunAbcState</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"p\">.)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yosys</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">.(</span><span class=\"n\">anonymous</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">namespace</span><span class=\"p\">)::</span><span class=\"n\">AbcPass</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">execute</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"p\">.)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yosys</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Yosys</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">Pass</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">call</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"p\">.)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yosys</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Yosys</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">run_pass</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"p\">.)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yosys</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">function</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">4355</span><span class=\"p\">]:</span><span class=\"mh\">0x3e41d4</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yosys</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">_start</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">function</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">30</span><span class=\"p\">]:</span><span class=\"mh\">0x12624</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">wasi</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nc\">cli</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"o\">@</span><span class=\"mf\">0.2.3</span><span class=\"p\">#</span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"c1\">//wasm/00021de6:wasm-function[51]:0xdba)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>I don't know which adapter version YoWASP's build uses. It is reproducible with the published npm packages above. A downstream workaround exists (passing the commands inline), so this is not urgent for us. Still, the trap and its message look like an adapter bug in the descriptor freelist's bookkeeping when files are opened and closed in this nested pattern.<br>\n</p>\n</blockquote>",
        "id": 632483749,
        "sender_full_name": "Wasmtime GitHub notifications bot",
        "timestamp": 1792220577
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>alexcrichton <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/14794#issuecomment-6252968405\">commented</a> on <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/14794\">issue #14794</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Without diving too deeply here you may be affected by #11277 perhaps. Can you try updating <code>jco</code> which updates the adapter to see if that fixes things?</p>\n</blockquote>",
        "id": 632814077,
        "sender_full_name": "Wasmtime GitHub notifications bot",
        "timestamp": 1792344807
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>pmnmalo <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/14794#issuecomment-6253559277\">commented</a> on <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/14794\">issue #14794</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Thanks! <code>@yowasp/yosys</code> 0.70.1258, where this reproduces, is built with <code>jco new --wasi-command</code> from <code>@bytecodealliance/jco</code> 1.19.0 (released 2026-04-22; see the package's <code>transpile</code> script), so its adapter should already include #11277 (merged 2025-07-18). The trap reproduces with that package as published. Unless the adapter jco 1.19.0 embeds predates that fix, this looks like a separate case. Is there a newer adapter build I could try, or a way to check which adapter version a component embeds?</p>\n</blockquote>",
        "id": 632820483,
        "sender_full_name": "Wasmtime GitHub notifications bot",
        "timestamp": 1792348260
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>pmnmalo <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/14794#issuecomment-6253574372\">commented</a> on <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/14794\">issue #14794</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>For context on our side: we have a workaround, so nothing is blocked. Our tool (Silinx, an FPGA IDE that runs YoWASP Yosys in the browser and in Node) gives ABC its script <strong>inline</strong> instead of from a file: <code>abc -script +read_lut,lut.lib;strash;dc2;…</code> rather than <code>abc -script x.abc</code> with <code>read_lut lut.lib</code> inside <code>x.abc</code>. Yosys then has one <code>source</code> level less, so <code>read_lut</code>'s <code>fopen</code> happens while fewer files are open, and the trap doesn't occur. The script and its LUT library are the same either way; only how they reach ABC changes.</p>\n<p>A permanent fix would still be great to have: reading a script from a file is ABC's usual way, and other YoWASP users will hit the trap with nothing pointing them to the inline form. I'm glad to test a newer adapter build against the reproduction above.</p>\n</blockquote>",
        "id": 632820643,
        "sender_full_name": "Wasmtime GitHub notifications bot",
        "timestamp": 1792348351
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>alexcrichton <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/14794#issuecomment-6269495948\">commented</a> on <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/14794\">issue #14794</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>IIRC jco updated its adapter pretty recently, so I think if that's built with jco 1.19 it may still be worth trying to update. I'm not entirely certain though, but if you can I think it'd be worth a shot</p>\n</blockquote>",
        "id": 633021240,
        "sender_full_name": "Wasmtime GitHub notifications bot",
        "timestamp": 1792419713
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>pmnmalo <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/14794#issuecomment-6285552971\">commented</a> on <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/14794\">issue #14794</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Thanks, that makes sense: jco is at 1.39.0 now, so 1.19.0's adapter is a lot of releases behind. I can't easily rebuild the component on our side, because the npm package ships only the transpiled output, not the <code>yosys.wasm</code> core module that <code>jco new</code> takes. The rebuild fits best in YoWASP's build, where that module exists. I'll mention it on the YoWASP issue (<a href=\"http://codeberg.org/YoWASP/yosys/issues/41\">codeberg.org/YoWASP/yosys/issues/41</a>) so it can be tried with a current jco. If the trap is gone there, this can be closed; if not, I'll come back here with what it shows.</p>\n</blockquote>",
        "id": 633227009,
        "sender_full_name": "Wasmtime GitHub notifications bot",
        "timestamp": 1792480587
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>pmnmalo <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/14794#issuecomment-6346759515\">commented</a> on <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/14794\">issue #14794</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Update: the reproduction above no longer traps with YoWASP's new build, <code>@yowasp/yosys</code> 0.71.188-dev.1267 (published today), which is built with a current adapter/jco. With the same script on Node 25, 0.70.1258 still gives <code>RuntimeError: unreachable</code> on the nested <code>abc -script x.abc</code> call, and 0.71.188-dev.1267 runs it. So it looks fixed by the newer adapter. Thanks! Feel free to close this, unless you want to keep it for the misleading <code>unreachable!</code> message in <code>Descriptors::open</code>.</p>\n</blockquote>",
        "id": 634040494,
        "sender_full_name": "Wasmtime GitHub notifications bot",
        "timestamp": 1792689370
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>alexcrichton closed <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/14794\">issue #14794</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The WASI preview1 component adapter traps with <code>unreachable</code> in <code>Descriptors::open</code> when a program opens a file while a few other files are still open, nested. As whitequark noted in the downstream report, the trap is probably this <code>unreachable!</code>: <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/blob/main/crates/wasi-preview1-component-adapter/src/descriptors.rs#L310\">https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/blob/main/crates/wasi-preview1-component-adapter/src/descriptors.rs#L310</a>. Its message is also misleading: it should say that the freelist points to an open descriptor.</p>\n<p>Downstream report, with the discussion: <a href=\"https://codeberg.org/YoWASP/yosys/issues/41\">https://codeberg.org/YoWASP/yosys/issues/41</a> (YoWASP Yosys: Yosys + ABC compiled to WASI, adapted to a component with the preview1 adapter, and run in Node through jco).</p>\n<h3>Reproduction</h3>\n<p>@yowasp/yosys 0.68.1207 and 0.70.1258, Node 25:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"JavaScript\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"k\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">runYosys</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kr\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s1\">'@yowasp/yosys'</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"kd\">const</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">files</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"s1\">'t.v'</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s1\">'module top(input a, b, c, output y); assign y = (a &amp; b) | c; endmodule\\n'</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"s1\">'lut.lib'</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s1\">'1 1 1\\n2 1 1\\n3 1 1\\n4 1 1\\n'</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"s1\">'x.abc'</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s1\">'read_lut lut.lib\\n'</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"p\">};</span>\n<span class=\"c1\">// traps: RuntimeError: unreachable</span>\n<span class=\"k\">await</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">runYosys</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"s1\">'-p'</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s1\">'read_verilog t.v; proc; techmap; abc -script x.abc'</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">files</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"c1\">// works: the same command given inline</span>\n<span class=\"k\">await</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">runYosys</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"s1\">'-p'</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s1\">'read_verilog t.v; proc; techmap; abc -script +read_lut,lut.lib;strash;if'</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">files</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>The two calls differ in nesting. In the first, Yosys's ABC script <code>source</code>s <code>x.abc</code>, whose file is still open, and <code>read_lut</code> then calls <code>fopen</code> on <code>lut.lib</code>. In the second there is one <code>source</code> level less, and the same <code>fopen</code> works. A missing file (<code>read_lut nothing.lib</code>) gives ABC's normal \"Cannot open input file\" error, not a trap. Native Yosys runs both without error.</p>\n<h3>Backtrace (Node, @yowasp/yosys 0.70.1258)</h3>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Rust\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">RuntimeError</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">unreachable</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">_ZN22wasi_snapshot_preview111descriptors11Descriptors4open17hf43b776c170aa288E</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"c1\">//wasm/00021de6:wasm-function[102]:0x4cac)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">path_open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"c1\">//wasm/00021de6:wasm-function[78]:0x3472)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"c1\">//wasm/c8fd64d6:wasm-function[18]:0x317</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yosys</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">__wasi_path_open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">function</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">46148</span><span class=\"p\">]:</span><span class=\"mh\">0x2875534</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yosys</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">__wasilibc_nocwd_openat_nomode</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">function</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">46157</span><span class=\"p\">]:</span><span class=\"mh\">0x28756da</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yosys</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">__wasilibc_open_nomode</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">function</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">46174</span><span class=\"p\">]:</span><span class=\"mh\">0x287620a</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yosys</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">fopen</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">function</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">46359</span><span class=\"p\">]:</span><span class=\"mh\">0x28816ad</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yosys</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">abc</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">If_CommandReadLut</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">abc</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">Abc_Frame_t_</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">int</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">char</span><span class=\"o\">**</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">function</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">23010</span><span class=\"p\">]:</span><span class=\"mh\">0x1828002</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yosys</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">abc</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">CmdCommandDispatch</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"p\">.)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yosys</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">abc</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">Cmd_CommandExecute</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"p\">.)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yosys</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">abc</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">CmdCommandSource</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">abc</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">Abc_Frame_t_</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">int</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">char</span><span class=\"o\">**</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">function</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">19831</span><span class=\"p\">]:</span><span class=\"mh\">0x14b75c8</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yosys</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">abc</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">CmdCommandDispatch</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"p\">.)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yosys</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">abc</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">Cmd_CommandExecute</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"p\">.)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yosys</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">abc</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">CmdCommandSource</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">abc</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">Abc_Frame_t_</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">int</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">char</span><span class=\"o\">**</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">function</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">19831</span><span class=\"p\">]:</span><span class=\"mh\">0x14b75c8</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yosys</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">abc</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">CmdCommandDispatch</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"p\">.)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yosys</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">abc</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">Cmd_CommandExecute</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"p\">.)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yosys</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">abc</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">Abc_RealMain</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">int</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">char</span><span class=\"o\">**</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">function</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">21311</span><span class=\"p\">]:</span><span class=\"mh\">0x1618f7e</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yosys</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">.(</span><span class=\"n\">anonymous</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">namespace</span><span class=\"p\">)::</span><span class=\"n\">RunAbcState</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"p\">.)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yosys</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">.(</span><span class=\"n\">anonymous</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">namespace</span><span class=\"p\">)::</span><span class=\"n\">AbcPass</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">execute</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"p\">.)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yosys</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Yosys</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">Pass</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">call</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"p\">.)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yosys</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Yosys</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">run_pass</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">..</span><span class=\"p\">.)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yosys</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">function</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">4355</span><span class=\"p\">]:</span><span class=\"mh\">0x3e41d4</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yosys</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">_start</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">function</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">30</span><span class=\"p\">]:</span><span class=\"mh\">0x12624</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">wasi</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nc\">cli</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"o\">@</span><span class=\"mf\">0.2.3</span><span class=\"p\">#</span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">wasm</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"c1\">//wasm/00021de6:wasm-function[51]:0xdba)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>I don't know which adapter version YoWASP's build uses. It is reproducible with the published npm packages above. A downstream workaround exists (passing the commands inline), so this is not urgent for us. Still, the trap and its message look like an adapter bug in the descriptor freelist's bookkeeping when files are opened and closed in this nested pattern.<br>\n</p>\n</blockquote>",
